{"parse": {"title": "Grand Gold Chest", "pageid": 81649, "revid": 15354805, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs=Grand gold chest}}\n{{Infobox Scenery\n|version1 = Closed\n|version2 = Opened\n|name1 = Grand Gold Chest\n|name2 = Opened gold chest\n|image1 = [[File:Grand Gold Chest.png|250x250px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Opened gold chest.png|250x250px]]\n|release = [[17 July]] [[2006]]\n|update = Pyramid Plunder\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|location = [[Jalsavrah Pyramid]]\n|options1 = Search\n|options2 = None\n|examine1 = Anyone lost an ark?\n|examine2 = Phew, no evil ghosts in here...\n|map = {{Map|name=Grand Gold Chest|x:1926,y:4434|x:1927,y:4468|x:1936,y:4452|x:1951,y:4427|x:1953,y:4468|x:1955,y:4450|x:1972,y:4431|x:1975,y:4458|plane=0|mapID=10129|mtype=pin}}\n|dropversion = Room 1,Room 2,Room 3,Room 4,Room 5,Room 6,Room 7,Room 8\n|id1 = 20946\n|id2 = 20947\n|leagueRegion = desert\n}}\nThe '''Grand Gold Chest''' can be found and looted in every room when playing the [[Pyramid Plunder]] minigame, providing Thieving experience, artefacts, and a chance to obtain the [[Pharaoh's sceptre]]. The chance of receiving a Pharaoh's sceptre scales depending on the room where it is situated, upon searching the Grand Gold Chest regardless of if the player fails or succeeds the search.\n\nPlayers can also receive [[Rocky]], the Thieving [[pet]], by looting the chest, with the rarity depending on the room.\n\nThere is also a chance of finding a [[scarab swarm]] inside of the chest, which is considered as \"failing\" to loot the chest, meaning that no Thieving experience is given, even though the loot inside is still obtained normally. The swarm will attack the player rapidly (0.6s/attack), but will not deal more than 1 damage per hit. Finding a scarab swarm instantly and unavoidably damages the player by 3 hitpoints, but the swarm's subsequent hits can be completely negated with [[Protect from Melee]], although this will not negate the chance of being poisoned by it. The pet [[Rocky]] can be obtained, regardless of whether the player finds scarabs or not. {{CiteTwitter|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1054808862493233154|date=23 October 2018|quote=No, it rolls for the pet even if you got scarabs.|author=Mod Ash|archivedate=21 June 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/100732}}\n\n==Thieving info==\n:''Note: If a [[Scarab Swarm#Pyramid Plunder|Scarab Swarm]] is spawned, no experience is awarded, but there is still a chance to receive a [[Pharaoh's sceptre]] or [[Rocky]].''\n{{Skill info\n|version1 = Room 1\n|version2 = Room 2\n|version3 = Room 3\n|version4 = Room 4\n|version5 = Room 5\n|version6 = Room 6\n|version7 = Room 7\n|version8 = Room 8\n|dropversion1 = Room 1\n|dropversion2 = Room 2\n|dropversion3 = Room 3\n|dropversion4 = Room 4\n|dropversion5 = Room 5\n|dropversion6 = Room 6\n|dropversion7 = Room 7\n|dropversion8 = Room 8\n|skill1name = Thieving\n|skill1lvl1 = 21\n|skill1lvl2 = 31\n|skill1lvl3 = 41\n|skill1lvl4 = 51\n|skill1lvl5 = 61\n|skill1lvl6 = 71\n|skill1lvl7 = 81\n|skill1lvl8 = 91\n|skill1exp1 = 40\n|skill1exp2 = 60\n|skill1exp3 = 100\n|skill1exp4 = 140\n|skill1exp5 = 200\n|skill1exp6 = 300\n|skill1exp7 = 450\n|skill1exp8 = 550\n}}\n\n===Thieving chance===\n{{Skilling success chart|label=Chance of successfully looting grand gold chest|showbefore=no\n|label1=Chance|low1=130|high1=220|req1=21|color1=#897b31|image1=Pharaoh's sceptre.png\n}}\n\n==Loot==\n\n===Room 1===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 1}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone seal|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone scarab|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone statuette|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/4200|raritynotes={{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks?oldschool=1|title=Poll 80 ToA Changes & DMM Tweaks|newsdate=30 August 2023|name=news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Room 2===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 2}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone scarab|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone statuette|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/2800|raritynotes={{NamedRef|news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Room 3===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 3}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone scarab|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone statuette|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Gold seal|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/1600|raritynotes={{NamedRef|news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Room 4===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 4}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone statuette|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Gold seal|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/950|raritynotes={{NamedRef|news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Room 5===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 5}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Stone statuette|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Gold seal|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Golden scarab|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/800|raritynotes={{NamedRef|news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Room 6===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 6}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Gold seal|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Golden scarab|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/750|raritynotes={{NamedRef|news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Room 7===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 7}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Gold seal|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Golden scarab|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Golden statuette|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/650|raritynotes={{NamedRef|news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Room 8===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Desert|dropversion=Room 8}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Golden scarab|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Golden statuette|quantity=1|rarity=1/2|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pharaoh's sceptre|quantity=1|rarity=1/650|raritynotes={{NamedRef|news-poll-80-toa-changes--dmm-tweaks}}|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n== Drop rates for receiving Rocky ==\nShown below are the base chances of receiving [[Rocky]].{{CiteTwitter|url=https://twitter.com/JagexKieren/status/780410304731709440|date=26 September 2016|quote=Okay... first one! Thieving pet rates! Others soon :). Retweet! [https://pbs.twimg.com/media/CtSTBe9XEAABH3h.jpg]|author=Mod Kieren|archivedate=26 May 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/104505}}\n\nA player's actual chances of receiving it is '''1 in ''B'' - (''Lvl'' * 25)''', where ''B'' is the base chance and ''Lvl'' is the player's Thieving level.\n\nOne of the faster methods on average to receive Rocky is by thieving only the [[Grand Gold Chest]] in Pyramid Plunder.\n\nThe effective proximate rate if one opens the chest in every room is ~1/1644 at level 91 and ~1/1604 at level 99.\n\nTo find the pet chance for a method at a given level, refer to the [[Calculator:Skill pet chance|skill pet chance calculator]].\n{| class=\"wikitable sortable align-right-2\"\n!Method\n!Base chance\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 1)</sub>{{efn|Chance is rolled upon opening the Grand Gold Chest in the room, even if a [[scarab swarm]] appears.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/848615300522225669|date=2 April 2017|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/109173|archivedate=1 March 2023|quote=[Can you still get the change of the Rocky pet in PP if you get the scarab swarm, while opening the gold chest?] Yes.}}|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|41,355\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 2)</sub>{{efn|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|29,540\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 3)</sub>{{efn|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|25,847\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 4)</sub>{{efn|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|20,678\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 5)</sub>{{efn|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|20,678\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 6)</sub>{{efn|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|20,678\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 7)</sub>{{efn|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|10,339\n|-\n|[[Grand Gold Chest]]<sub>(room 8)</sub>{{efn|name=Pyramid Plunder}}\n|6,893\n|}\n{{notelist}}\n\nIf the player searches all [[Grand Gold Chest|Grand Gold Chests]] in rooms 1-8 in [[Pyramid Plunder]], the approximate cumulative rates for obtaining Rocky per run are as below.\n{| class=\"wikitable\"\n|+\n!Room\n!Level Req\n!Chance for Rocky (level 91)\n!Cumulative Rate (level 91)\n!Chance for Rocky (level 99)\n!Cumulative Rate (level 99)\n|-\n|'''1'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|21+}}\n|1/39,080\n|1/39,080\n|1/38,880\n|1/38,880\n|-\n|'''2'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|31+}}\n|1/27,265\n|~1/16,060\n|1/27,065\n|~1/15,957\n|-\n|'''3'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|41+}}\n|1/23,572\n|~1/9,552\n|1/23,372\n|~1/9,483\n|-\n|'''4'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|51+}}\n|1/18,403\n|~1/6,289\n|1/18,203\n|~1/6,235\n|-\n|'''5'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|61+}}\n|1/18,403\n|~1/4,687\n|1/18,203\n|~1/4,645\n|-\n|'''6'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|71+}}\n|1/18,403\n|~1/3,736\n|1/18,203\n|~1/3,701\n|-\n|'''7'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|81+}}\n|1/8,064\n|~1/2,553\n|1/7,864\n|~1/2,517\n|-\n|'''8'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|91+}}\n|1/4,618\n|~1/1,644\n|1/4,418\n|~1/1,604\n|}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 30 August 2023\n|update = Poll 80 ToA Changes & DMM Tweaks\n|poll =\n|change =\n* The drop rate of the [[pharaoh's sceptre]] has been adjusted; previously, it was reduced once players reached the sixth room, and becoming four times rarer in the eighth room.\n* The Grand Gold Chest will now roll the sceptre if players fail to open it.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Historical==\nBefore 30 August 2023, the player only had a chance of obtaining the sceptre if scarabs did not spawn. This meant the effective rates of obtaining a sceptre were far lower than stated.\n{| class=\"wikitable\"\n!Room\n!Lvl Req\n! colspan=\"2\" |Start\n! colspan=\"2\" |24 March 2021\n!30 August 2023\n|-\n!\n!\n!Lvl Req\n!Lvl 99\n!Lvl Req\n!Lvl 99\n!All Levels\n|-\n|'''1'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|21+}}\n|1/1,741\n|1/1,164\n|1/6,095\n|1/4,073\n|1/4,200\n|-\n|'''2'''\n| {{SCP|Thieving|31+}} \n|1/1,652\n|1/1,169\n|1/3,716\n|1/2,630\n|1/2,800\n|-\n|'''3''' \n|{{SCP|Thieving|41+}} \n|1/1,571\n|1/1,174\n|1/1,963\n|1/1,468\n|1/1,600\n|-\n| '''4'''\n| {{SCP|Thieving|51+}}\n|1/1,488\n|1/1,180\n|1/1,116\n|1/885\n|1/950\n|-\n|'''5'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|61+}}\n|1/1,422\n|1/1,185\n|1/924\n|1/770\n|1/800\n|-\n|'''6'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|71+}}\n|1/1,362\n|1/1,191\n|1/885\n|1/774\n|1/750\n|-\n|'''7'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|81+}}\n| 1/1,306\n|1/1,196\n| 1/849\n|1/778\n|1/650\n|-\n| '''8'''\n|{{SCP|Thieving|91+}}\n|1/1,255 \n|1/1,202\n|1/816\n|1/781\n|1/650\n|-\n|'''Total'''\n|\n|\n|1/148\n|\n|1/132\n|1/126\n|}\n\n==Trivia==\n* The examine texts are an allusion to the 1981 film ''{{wp|<!--Indiana Jones and the -->Raiders of the Lost Ark}}''.\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Pyramid Plunder}}\n[[Category:Thieving]]"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:55.873870+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-dr